  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 10.0.0.5 - 2026-11-26\n\n- Upgraded APF.CORE version\n- Replaced IsValidName validation with IsValidNameWithSpecialCharactersAndPunctuation for Name Validator\n\n## 10.0.0.4 - 2026-11-19\n\n- Downgraded AutoMapper version to 14.0.0\n\n## 10.0.0.3 - 2026-11-17\n\n- Overrode the vulnerable transitive Microsoft.AspNetCore.WebUtilities 2.3.10 dependency with version 10.0.15.\n\n## 10.0.0.2 - 2026-10-28\n\n- Removed ISDCode Validation from ContactValidator.cs\n\n## 10.0.0.1 - 2026-09-21\n\n- dotnet 10 release version",
